WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Lily jumps forward after the wind-Spire knockdown.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.350
Lily retreats as Ryu attempts the recorded throw.

3
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.350
Standing heavy punch punishes the whiffed throw.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:02.950
Forward heavy punch continues the punish.

5
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.850
Heavy Condor Wind ends the conversion and gains a Wind stock.

6
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.000
Ryu falls after the heavy Wind finish.
